---
const calendlyUrl = "https://calendly.com/gawen-francois/audit-perte-de-temps-gflux";
---

<section id="offre" class="section-padding bg-surface relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background decoration -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-accent-blue/3 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-0"></div>

  <div class="container-narrow relative z-10">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <div class="reveal badge bg-green-50 text-green-600 border border-green-100 mb-6">
        L'offre
      </div>
      <h2 class="reveal font-display text-section text-deep-tech mb-5">
        L'offre <span class="text-accent-blue">irrésistible</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- ═══ GUARANTEE BLOCK — Dedicated visual prominence ═══ -->
    <div class="reveal max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 via-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 border-2 border-green-200 shadow-card overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Decorative corner glow -->
        <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-40 h-40 bg-green-300/20 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>

        <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <!-- Badge -->
          <div class="badge bg-green-100 text-green-700 border border-green-200 mb-5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" /></svg>
            Garantie résultat
          </div>

          <!-- Shield icon -->
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-green-100 text-green-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-9 h-9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" /></svg>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-deep-tech mb-3">
            5h de gagnées par semaine minimum
          </h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
            <strong class="text-green-700">Ou vous ne payez rien. Zéro risque pour vous.</strong><br/>
            Nous nous engageons sur un résultat mesurable. Si nous ne tenons pas cette promesse, votre investissement vous est intégralement remboursé.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Offer Card -->
    <div class="reveal max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-card border border-deep-tech/5 overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Urgency Banner -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-blue to-deep-blue px-6 py-3 text-center">
          <p class="text-white text-sm font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-pulse-soft" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            Limité aux 5 prochaines ESN
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
          <!-- What you get -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-deep-tech text-base">Ce que comprend l'audit gratuit :</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {[
                "Cartographie complète de vos tâches répétitives",
                "Estimation du temps récupérable par semaine",
                "Proposition d'architecture IA personnalisée",
                "Plan d'implémentation sur 30 jours",
              ].map(item => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-secondary">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-blue flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
                  <span>{item}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Urgency note — credible scarcity justification -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-8 p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-amber-100/50">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126z" /></svg>
            <p class="text-sm text-amber-800">
              <strong>Pourquoi seulement 5 places ?</strong> Chaque audit est mené personnellement par notre équipe fondatrice, pas par un bot. Nous analysons en profondeur votre organisation pendant plusieurs jours. Pour garantir cette qualité d'accompagnement, nous limitons volontairement le nombre de clients intégrés chaque mois.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- CTA -->
          <div class="text-center">
            <a href={calendlyUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto text-lg !px-12 !py-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.59 14.37a6 6 0 01-5.84 7.38v-4.8m5.84-2.58a14.98 14.98 0 006.16-12.12A14.98 14.98 0 009.631 8.41m5.96 5.96a14.926 14.926 0 01-5.841 2.58m-.119-8.54a6 6 0 00-7.381 5.84h4.8m2.581-5.84a14.927 14.927 0 00-2.58 5.84m2.699 2.7c-.103.021-.207.041-.311.06a15.09 15.09 0 01-2.448-2.448 14.9 14.9 0 01.06-.312m-2.24 2.39a4.493 4.493 0 00-1.757 4.306 4.493 4.493 0 004.306-1.758M16.5 9a1.5 1.5 0 11-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 013 0z" /></svg>
              Éradiquer mes tâches répétitives
            </a>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-4">
              Gratuit · Sans engagement · Résultats en 48h
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
